<title>USA: Quick &amp; Reilly payout raised.</title>
<headline>Quick &amp; Reilly payout raised.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quick &amp; Reilly Group said Wednesday its quarterly dividend was raised to $0.09, a 12.5 percent increase from $0.08 paid previously.</p>
<p>The group said it also declared a special year-end dividend for fiscal 1997 of $0.10 per share, an increase of 25 percent from the $0.08 special dividend paid in fiscal year 1996. Both the regular and special year-end dividends are payable on April 1 to shareholders of record on March 3.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
